{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"1d39004d3482af40740993a0d89bd4003177b321b5f90b00b5dd6e09776dbd11","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_e90fa85bdadf00e802d28b1ae109e100c543e24abebdf8cba38755edcc1a1d4e","overall_assessment":"The paper is clearly written and well-organized, with a logical flow from introduction to method and experiments. The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined, and the tables are readable and informative. The only minor issue is the placement of the figure caption, which is separated from the figure reference in the text.","paper_id":"B1-Hhnslg","paper_identity_sha256":"8b41fab504bba5cd368d65a50d921d9a1e1dde9d8647d3247eeffe33da2aaec7","prompt_identity_sha256":"c8e4a344b1cf6b0ba0e40b443c51de873640745c3be8a287660afb59781d7810","raw_response_sha256":"9f2852704abea9510f5fa9d8cf98db3c605f862990271c178eeb57231b138fb3","request_identity_sha256":"c9038fd037eb6836eaf3b3ea81a599a0437cc04d7ee9433f3d8121480c5fb677","reviewer_identity_sha256":"640674960e873d7799fe18b4859a7e0c00d96250d3f1e125e872e6afcbdb5673","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"98ba258e35effc96bb572e01fd8207b5dfb92baadea855dbf359198bf89ec9d6","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001","SRC-002","SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-005","SRC-006","SRC-007","SRC-008","SRC-009","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023","SRC-024","SRC-025","SRC-026","SRC-027","SRC-028"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured and clearly written. The introduction effectively sets the context and motivates the proposed method. The related work section provides a comprehensive overview of existing approaches and clearly differentiates the proposed method from them. The method section is well-organized, with clear subsections for prototype normalization, predicting the weights of a linear classifier, and design choices. The experiments section is detailed and provides sufficient information for reproducibility. The conclusion summarizes the key contributions and findings. The writing is concise and readable, with no excessive jargon or redundancy. All specialized terms and assumptions are clearly defined and consistently used.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. The equations are clearly presented and well-explained. The use of symbols is consistent throughout the paper. The derivations are well-explained, and the steps are easy to follow. The notation for the embedding function, prototypes, and class distribution is clear and unambiguous. The mathematical explanation of the equivalence to a linear classifier is particularly well-done, providing valuable insight into the nature of the learned classifier.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-018","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-024"],"review_text":"The tables are readable and informative. Table 1, Table 2, and Table 3 are well-structured and provide clear comparisons of the proposed method with existing approaches. The table captions are descriptive and provide sufficient context. The figure reference in the text is consistent with the figure caption. The caption for Figure 1 is detailed and provides a clear description of the t-SNE visualization. However, the figure caption is placed after the references, which may be slightly confusing for the reader. It would be more intuitive to place the figure caption immediately after the figure reference in the text.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"b2af8d5800e62241ace24092a1d197d4ba3fdcd9543f2c826ea89d1aeac3f2bd","paper_id":"B1-Hhnslg","paper_ordinal":0,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"9f2852704abea9510f5fa9d8cf98db3c605f862990271c178eeb57231b138fb3","a